      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.048645255450659695,
        "y0": 0.7123191636748829,
        "x1": 0.3189105798090237,
        "y1": 0.7275527506875283
      },
      "text": "être… nôtre, ici, dans le Jura, départe-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6756635291242737,
        "y0": 0.7076272760322584,
        "x1": 0.9485954004069939,
        "y1": 0.7228608630449038
      },
      "text": "ment de nombreux outils de proximité",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.048645255450659695,
        "y0": 0.7301119821482405,
        "x1": 0.488943849506361,
        "y1": 0.7453455691608859
      },
      "text": "ment rural et montagnard, et de surcroît deuxième département",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5080757846645582,
        "y0": 0.725420094505616,
        "x1": 0.9482983188612384,
        "y1": 0.7406536815182614
      },
      "text": "tout en reconnaissant son importance en termes de… proximité !",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.048645255450659695,
        "y0": 0.747904800621598,
        "x1": 0.4887156117350675,
        "y1": 0.7631383876342435
      },
      "text": "le plus industriel de France. Justement, prenons l’exemple de",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5080757846645582,
        "y0": 0.7432129129789735,
        "x1": 0.944626262928393,
        "y1": 0.758446499991619
      },
      "text": "La structure départementale, avant NOTRe, permettait d’or-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.048645255450659695,
        "y0": 0.7656976190949556,
        "x1": 0.4893207153418777,
        "y1": 0.780931206107601
      },
      "text": "l’Aide à l’Immobilier d’Entreprises (AIE) auparavant gérée par",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5080757846645582,
        "y0": 0.7610057314523311,
        "x1": 0.9478038424862559,
        "y1": 0.7762393184649765
      },
      "text": "ganiser les équilibres démographiques et socioéconomiques.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.048645255450659695,
        "y0": 0.7834904498023179,
        "x1": 0.48818674256996925,
        "y1": 0.7987240368149634
      },
      "text": "les Services Économiques du Département. Le chef d’entreprise",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5080757846645582,
        "y0": 0.7787985499256886,
        "x1": 0.9499052361429128,
        "y1": 0.7940321369383341
      },
      "text": "Le Jura a une vision de l’existence et du développement de",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.048645255450659695,
        "y0": 0.8012832805096802,
        "x1": 0.4883642931666588,
        "y1": 0.8165168675223258
      },
      "text": "devra désormais s’adresser à la Région, l’échelon de proximité",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5080757846645582,
        "y0": 0.796591380633051,
        "x1": 0.9487041072292214,
        "y1": 0.8118249676456964
      },
      "text": "son territoire, à forte valeur ajoutée identitaire, et NOTRe va",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.048645255450659695,
        "y0": 0.8190761112170426,
        "x1": 0.28534045242999145,
        "y1": 0.834309698229688
      },
      "text": "départementale étant supprimé.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5080757846645582,
        "y0": 0.8143842113404134,
        "x1": 0.7661021349599025,
        "y1": 0.8296177983530588
      },
      "text": "le rendre volontairement… aveugle.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.048645255450659695,
        "y0": 0.8414237842454418,
        "x1": 0.48909783143977315,
        "y1": 0.8566573712580874
      },
      "text": "Que pèsera l’entrepreneur jurassien dans la balance régionale?",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5080757846645582,
        "y0": 0.8367318843688126,
        "x1": 0.944626262928393,
        "y1": 0.8519654713814581
      },
      "text": "Aussi le Jura n’entend pas laisser la main à la « mégalopolisa-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.048645255450659695,
        "y0": 0.8592166149528042,
        "x1": 0.4851957628116097,
        "y1": 0.8744502019654496
      },
      "text": "Qui l’écoutera, qui sera disponible rapidement ? En termes éco-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5080757846645582,
        "y0": 0.854524715076175,
        "x1": 0.9486915954697037,
        "y1": 0.8697583020888204
      },
      "text": "tion » hexagonale tout en tendant la main à la Région. Celle-ci",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04864528454777485,
        "y0": 0.8770094456601665,
        "x1": 0.48931163704194863,
        "y1": 0.892243032672812
      },
      "text": "nomiques et de développement de l’attractivité territoriale,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5080757846645582,
        "y0": 0.8723175457835373,
        "x1": 0.9487313421290086,
        "y1": 0.8875511327961828
      },
      "text": "doit croire en la spécificité jurassienne et faire confiance aux",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04864528454777485,
        "y0": 0.8948022763675288,
        "x1": 0.4893134410630884,
        "y1": 0.9100358633801744
      },
      "text": "le Jura perd la main et donc la maîtrise de son destin; cela est",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5080757846645582,
        "y0": 0.8901103764908996,
        "x1": 0.9504069286024541,
        "y1": 0.9053439635035451
      },
      "text": "élus de terrain, aux agents des services départementaux,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04864528454777485,
        "y0": 0.9125951070748912,
        "x1": 0.4848841618053907,
        "y1": 0.9278286940875367
      },
      "text": "grave et va contribuer au déséquilibre des territoires ruraux.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5080757846645582,
        "y0": 0.907903207198262,
        "x1": 0.9489269329370956,
        "y1": 0.9231367942109074
      },
      "text": "bref à la collectivité territoriale. Oui, faire confiance aussi",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5080757846645582,
        "y0": 0.9256960379056243,
        "x1": 0.9487368123866582,
        "y1": 0.9409296249182698
      },
      "text": "aux Jurassiens, héritiers d’une riche et intense histoire – des",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.04864528454777485,
        "y0": 0.9349427801032905,
        "x1": 0.48933520570522604,
        "y1": 0.950176367115936
      },
      "text": "Autre exemple, ancré dans la vie quotidienne des Jurassiens,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5080757846645582,
        "y0": 0.9434888686129866,
        "x1": 0.8338963182840111,
        "y1": 0.9587224556256322
      },
      "text": "Jurassiens qui souhaitent continuer à l’écrire.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    }
